WEBVTT

00:00:00.521 --> 00:00:03.718
I cast everything aside for this very moment

00:00:05.865 --> 00:00:14.536
Reaching out my hand until the ideal becomes reality

00:00:22.293 --> 00:00:27.053
The choices spread before me

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:32.836
The gears of good and evil turn toward the one ending I have envisioned

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:38.040
Every choice is coincidence — and another cue for what comes next

00:00:38.446 --> 00:00:43.706
I gaze beyond the limits of possibility itself

00:00:43.993 --> 00:00:49.110
Only one — nothing else matters, only that one thing

00:00:49.173 --> 00:00:54.440
Conviction and resolve I will never surrender, hidden within me

00:00:56.930 --> 00:01:01.580
Highest, highest, I'm going on

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:07.406
Walk the shadows deeper than truth itself

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:12.336
Highest, highest, I'll carry on

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:21.250
If that is what I seek, then I shall see it through alone

00:01:29.013 --> 00:01:33.710
My current place reflected upon the board

00:01:33.833 --> 00:01:39.443
Schemes layered in light and darkness, their full shape still unseen

00:01:39.823 --> 00:01:44.733
For now, the choice is silence — a lie reserved for the appointed time

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:50.446
Until the very last divergence, that figure remains concealed

00:01:50.676 --> 00:01:55.876
In the light, no one notices — in the night, none can stand above me

00:01:55.880 --> 00:02:01.126
Resolve, ideology, desire — all sleeping within my chest

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:08.190
Highest, highest, I'm going on

00:02:08.233 --> 00:02:14.063
Walk the path of glory that none will ever recognize

00:02:14.256 --> 00:02:18.966
Highest, highest, I'll carry on

00:02:19.003 --> 00:02:27.943
Beyond the light itself, embracing the role of solitude

00:02:35.586 --> 00:02:40.366
The choices spread before me

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:46.040
Without hesitation, the gears turn toward the ending I desired

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:51.000
I'll keep trying for my belief

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:56.590
No matter what may happen, I will never falter

00:02:56.910 --> 00:03:01.616
Highest, highest, I'm going on

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:07.380
Walk the shadows deeper than truth itself

00:03:07.556 --> 00:03:12.326
Highest, highest, I'll carry on

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:21.483
If that is what I seek, then I shall see it through alone

